  "rules": [
    [
      "Build",
      "Choose 10 Basics and 5 Hero cards, max two copies. Start on spaces 3 and 5 with 18 Health and 0 Coins. Draw five."
    ],
    [
      "Lead",
      "Attacker chooses one opening card, optionally pairing one movement card with an Attack and one attack-timing Loot. Resolve approach movement and printed pre-Attack effects."
    ],
    [
      "Answer",
      "Defender sees the opening and chooses one defence/healing/movement card OR one defence-timing Loot, or takes the hit. Block/healing applies before the Attack. Ordinary response movement is capped at one space and evades before the hit only if strictly faster; otherwise it happens after the opening. Loot movement uses its printed allowance."
    ],
